    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAim for the top with your Mouse Aim Skill!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAMNYAM\u201d is a platform game where you climb up and aim for the top using your \u201cmouse aim skill.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports multiplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim accurately at the \u201ctargets\u201d floating around you and click to make the cat girl jump high.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However, if you do nothing, the character will fall back to the original height.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you need to <u>click on the next target during the airtime</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbecbb60a939d66f8611326.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbecbb60a939d66f8611326.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbecbb60a939d66f8611326.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cContinuous jumping feels great!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cat girl jumps towards the clicked location. Also, <u>to climb efficiently upwards, you need to minimize lateral speed as much as possible.</u> In other words, you need to instantly consider the target to aim at and the timing of the click based on the character's position and direction in a changing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/962c1f14a01d3fb5af5a0377b5876e37.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/962c1f14a01d3fb5af5a0377b5876e37.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/962c1f14a01d3fb5af5a0377b5876e37.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhoa!\u201d</strong> \u2191 Bad example</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple, but your judgment is constantly tested by various elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When you accidentally miss your aim, use the \u201cascend skill.\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/abe16a4dd3a53d21c5d24a9f21b87f6c.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/abe16a4dd3a53d21c5d24a9f21b87f6c.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/abe16a4dd3a53d21c5d24a9f21b87f6c.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/bd97de3c862c50babbab72243135810d.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=200 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/bd97de3c862c50babbab72243135810d.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/bd97de3c862c50babbab72243135810d.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the skill allows the cat girl to jump a little, giving you <u>time to adjust your aim.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This skill is also effective for <u>adding to the ascent speed when you click on a target.</u> Whether you can use it well depends on the player's discretion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Difficulty settings divided into three levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are difficulty levels for beginners who are not used to mouse controls, for gamers who are familiar with mouse controls, and for hardcore gamers at the highest difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The highest difficulty cannot be cleared with half-hearted determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Playable with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/25da0993b7712ffd3e23275e74ef9950.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/25da0993b7712ffd3e23275e74ef9950.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/25da0993b7712ffd3e23275e74ef9950.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you see your friends as allies or rivals...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can help your friends who seem to be falling by clicking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/457a64c08dff1ccd53918760ed950056.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=216 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/457a64c08dff1ccd53918760ed950056.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/457a64c08dff1ccd53918760ed950056.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/c639f1f355772b8cfd1d799671a98a7e.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=216 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/c639f1f355772b8cfd1d799671a98a7e.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/c639f1f355772b8cfd1d799671a98a7e.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping and being helped...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Competitive mini-games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Cute pixel art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Changing scenery as you progress upwards</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clearing the game requires great effort.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, the sense of achievement is all the more rewarding.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAim for the top with your Mouse Aim Skill!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAMNYAM\u201d is a platform game where you climb up and aim for the top using your \u201cmouse aim skill.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports multiplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim accurately at the \u201ctargets\u201d floating around you and click to make the cat girl jump high.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8bebdf05786c093c78043b981432519c.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However, if you do nothing, the character will fall back to the original height.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you need to <u>click on the next target during the airtime</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbecbb60a939d66f8611326.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=432 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbecbb60a939d66f8611326.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/8a13f9258fbe