/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.poster.avif?t=1748990059\" width=170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.webm?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652590/extras/a17b0609d6c55eee4ce533360bbe6993.mp4?t=1748990059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping and being helped...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Competitive mini-games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Cute pixel art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Changing scenery as you progress upwards</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clearing the game requires great effort.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, the sense of achievement is all the more rewarding.</strong></p>",
